<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">This
press release includes forward-looking statements within the meaning of Section 27A of the Act, and Section 21E of the Securities Exchange
